## 🔵 ADVANCED LEVEL

### 🔴 Meta Tags
```html
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="Page description for SEO">
```
**Important:** `viewport` meta tag responsive design ke liye compulsory hai.

### 🟡 Favicon
```html
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="favicon.png">
```

### 🔴 SEO Basics
- Ek hi `<h1>` per page
- `<title>` unique aur descriptive rakho
- `meta description` likho
- `alt` text images me
- Semantic tags use karo

### 🔴 Accessibility Basics
- Har image me `alt` text
- Form inputs me `label`
- Proper heading hierarchy (h1 → h2 → h3, skip mat karo)
- Keyboard navigable (tab se navigate ho sake)

### 🔵 ARIA Basics
```html
<button aria-label="Close menu">X</button>
<div role="alert">Error message</div>
```
ARIA (Accessible Rich Internet Applications) screen readers ke liye extra context deta hai jab semantic HTML kaafi nahi hota.

### 🔴 HTML Best Practices
- Semantic tags use karo, `<div>` soup avoid karo
- Lowercase tags/attributes likho
- Indentation consistent rakho
- Alt text hamesha do
- Forms me proper labels do

