## 📋 HTML Cheat Sheet

| Category | Tags |
|---|---|
| Structure | `html`, `head`, `body`, `header`, `nav`, `main`, `footer` |
| Text | `h1-h6`, `p`, `span`, `strong`, `em` |
| Lists | `ul`, `ol`, `li` |
| Links/Media | `a`, `img`, `video`, `audio`, `iframe` |
| Forms | `form`, `input`, `label`, `select`, `textarea`, `button` |
| Table | `table`, `tr`, `th`, `td` |
| Semantic | `section`, `article`, `aside`, `figure`, `details` |

## Common Mistakes
- Closing tags miss karna
- `alt` attribute skip karna
- Multiple `<h1>` use karna
- `div` overuse karna jab semantic tag available hai
- Form `name` attribute bhoolna

